WEBVTT

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.690
Officer Kokonose, where have you been? 
We were worried about you, chu.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.310
I'm sorry...

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:13.780
I heard that DeMille's after 
some brat named Chuta Kokonose.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.640
We should just hand him over.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:23.650
Stop it. It's not like DeMille will 
keep their promise if we hand the kid over.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.250
Hey, they're...

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.160
...from DeMille...

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.880
Apparently the Monitalien and 
its host are hiding here.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.340
It'll be bad news for you 
if you're hiding them.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.680
Monitalien? What are you talking about?

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.830
DeMille managed to find this place, chu.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.750
It seems a bit early for that to happen.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.930
Even if we knew, we wouldn't tell you.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.270
What?

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.860
Get the hell outta here.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.650
This is what happens when you defy us.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.170
You bastard!

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.230
I'm right here!

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.370
Don't.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.400
Everyone else has nothing to do 
with this. Leave them alone.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.870
So you're Chuta Kokonose.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.340
How nice of you to identify yourself.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.170
I don't plan on being that cooperative.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:17.930
I'm a part of ēlDLIVE. It's my duty 
to protect everyone here.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.760
How are you going to 
protect them all by yourself?

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:26.520
He's not the only one from ēlDLIVE here.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:27.440
Sonokata!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.300
You stay back!

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:35.480
That's enough, Officer Sonokata.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:37.520
Vega?

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:52.210
<b>Unidentified Flying Objects 
Appear Around the World</b>

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:52.990
<i>The identity of the flying object that has 
appeared in the sky is still a mystery.</i>

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:56.460
<i>It has been reported that similar incidents 
are occurring all over the world.</i>

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:57.370
Chuta...

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:57.620
<i>The governments...</i>

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.340
Any movement from the DeMille ship?

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.990
There are no signs of it coming after us.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:08.490
In our current situation, we aren't 
going to be able to get very far.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.480
Looks like they've got us figured out.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:14.750
Inspector Vega?

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.110
What are you—

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.430
What are you doing, Vega?

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.030
While investigating the
 mysterious message he got,

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:29.830
Chuta Kokonose ends up infecting the <i>Jeanrenoi-R</i>'s 
system with a virus and putting Earth in danger...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.240
He just couldn't handle 
the guilt anymore, and...

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:35.030
This is what you were supposed to think:

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:37.890
"If I hand myself over to DeMille, 
everyone will be okay."

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.250
Actually, I'm positive that you've 
thought that once already.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:42.770
Vega?

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.130
And to think...

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.270
...that's how you were going to act.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.470
However, if you've gone off script, 
we just need to rewrite the scenario.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:50.930
Chu!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.080
Sonokata, what are you...

00:02:57.080 --> 00:03:00.060
Do you still not understand? 
Inspector Vega...

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:01.850
That man

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:03.680
is working for DeMille.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.850
Vega... works for DeMille?

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.370
No...

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:17.700
"And there's a spy within ēlDLIVE."

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:23.090
"Be extremely careful. The spy's name is..."

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:26.060
Vega? You're joking, right?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.880
You can't be a spy...

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:30.390
You tricked me?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.850
You and Dolugh will be 
coming to DeMille.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:37.690
If you resist, I'll have to hurt you,
but just enough that you won't die.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:42.400
Chuta...

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:47.300
He's gone...

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:52.080
Dolugh's gone...

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.740
What are you talking about?

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.580
Dolugh has...

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:04.670
Dolugh has disappeared from within me.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:09.620
Are you actually trying to bluff now? 
We'll know soon enough when we check.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.650
If you want to take me, go ahead.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:17.840
That is, if I still have any 
worth left without Dolugh.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.650
You are really throwing off my plans.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:24.560
I'll give you another thirty minutes.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.160
You have until then to bring 
Dolugh back and bring him here.

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.920
If you don't, everyone will die.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.650
Sonokata, are you okay?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:38.640
Yes...

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:42.590
More importantly, is that true about Dolugh?

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.340
Hey, kid.

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.940
You're pretty tough.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.300
If you come any closer, I'll attack.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.690
Calm down. We aren't the enemy.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.390
Hey, is there anything that we can do?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.720
Does that Vega belong to DeMille?

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:07.730
Impossible. We worked together in the 
investigations department. He's one of us.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:12.110
There is no mistake that Inspector Vega 
is a member of DeMille.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.110
We were attacked, chu!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.240
But that's...

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.500
It is also believed that 
he was the one who sent

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.500
Officer Kokonose to infect 
the bureau's system.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:29.030
I thought that DeMille personnel have 
a recorder and a bomb planted within them...

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:33.440
Nothing has ever been detected 
within Inspector Vega's body.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:38.560
We checked out his family, as well. There are 
no connections to any criminal organizations.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:42.210
I know his father.

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:45.810
He was a former ēlDLIVE detective, 
and a very respectable man.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:49.130
So nothing suspicious about him at all...

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:52.450
How could he be a spy 
if his record's perfectly clean?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.640
Of course he's perfectly clean.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.620
Dr. Love, what do you mean?

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:01.580
Do you really think a criminal organization 
sending a spy into the police,

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:04.870
would leave him easily traceable?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.290
You've got a point...

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:10.330
Vega might have been "kusa."

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:10.880
Kusa?

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:15.700
During the Warring States Period in Japan, 
there were shinobi known as kusa, or grass.

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:20.880
After sneaking into enemy territory, 
they would blend in with the farmers,

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:26.210
create families, and then their mission 
would be handed down to their children.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:30.200
It's possible that not only his father,

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.870
who was an ēlDLIVE detective, but one of 
his grandparents might also have been a DeMille spy.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.530
That fate might have been 
handed down to Vega's generation.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:41.800
It's almost like a time bomb 
that was planted into ēlDLIVE...

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:45.290
To think that Vega-san was... 
I still can't believe it.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:47.700
I feel the same way.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:52.930
However, it's true that he has betrayed 
ēlDLIVE, and the Earth is in danger.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.550
I can't forgive Vega.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.130
Chuta...

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.310
I want to arrest Vega, 
and make him apologize.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:07.650
And more than anything, I want to 
protect the Earth... protect everyone.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.650
Why are you stating the obvious?

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:12.610
Huh?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:17.940
That's right, Chuta-san. 
Everyone here feels exactly the same way.

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:19.850
That's right, chu!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.580
We're Space Police ēlDLIVE, chu!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.930
Right, Chief?

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:27.090
Of course.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:34.050
Now, then. The problem is how we're going to 
approach this when we're obviously outgunned.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.730
I actually have an idea regarding that.

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:37.550
Idea?

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.080
Actually...

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:44.640
You weren't able to capture the Monitalien?

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:46.730
I'm very sorry.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.360
But Chuta Kokonose—

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.440
I guess you're just a miserable 
little spy, after all.

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:58.170
Either way, that planet 
will soon be a sea of flames.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.280
I can't wait to see it...

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:05.120
The sight of the Earthlings running around.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.710
All personnel to their battle stations.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.670
We will begin our attack 
on the DeMille ship shortly.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.860
Civilians and those with injuries, get to safety!

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:22.440
All those who can fight, 
check your equipment and wait for orders.

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:26.310
But are you sure this will work? 
Using those guys...

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.960
There are aliens who have a grudge 
against DeMille hiding all over the world. {M: he does say world...}

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.180
Their numbers are great.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.960
Those DeMille bastards! Today's the day 
that I'm gonna show 'em who's boss!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:42.740
If they help us out, 
we have a chance at winning this fight.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:46.030
Though I'm probably going to have to write 
a formal apology for this, no matter what.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.450
Chief Laine!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:48.790
You're back, Chuta.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.390
Let me fight, too!

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:54.540
It's too dangerous for you, 
since you don't have Dolugh.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.140
I know that...

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:58.070
But Vega...

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:01.270
I want to settle this myself!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.510
To be honest, you're just 
going to be in the way.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:08.070
However, if it was an order 
from the chief...

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:12.020
I would have no objections
 to backing up Officer Kokonose.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.650
We're all part of Division 2, chu!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.820
Sonokata... Assistant Inspector Chips...

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.530
Take this with you.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:22.990
What's this?

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:27.740
It's a special gun 
that can shoot SPH energy.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.700
You probably need that right now, don't you?

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:32.130
Thank you very much.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:35.410
All personnel, ready!

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:39.370
We will now begin our final battle 
with the DeMille ship.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:43.050
Our objective is to arrest 
Inspector Vega and DeMille Junior.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.570
Yoyosa!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:56.030
<b>Jeanrenoi-R</b>

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:58.580
How's the Earth suppression squad?

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.230
They are ready to go at any time.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:03.630
Please wait! There is still time 
until the deadline!

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:04.550
Begin!

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:05.650
Yes, sir!

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:07.950
What the?

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:10.140
ēlDLIVE is attacking, sir.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:14.590
What can a damaged ship do?

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:20.920
That visual's just a fake!

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:22.170
What?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:24.000
Now what?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.010
The <i>Jeanrenoi-R</i> is coming 
from a different direction!

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:30.100
ēlmeizer cannons at full power! Fire!

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.340
Evade!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.050
It's no use! We won't make it in time!

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.890
The main engine has been heavily damaged.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:43.780
This ship is my body. 
The laser cannons are my paw pads!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.650
Barrier SPH output is full.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.810
Here we go! Charge right into them!

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.550
Captain! They're ramming us!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.940
Shoot them down!

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:01.690
We won't make it in time!

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:14.650
Investigations Division 5 
is inside the enemy ship!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.900
Investigations Division 1 is inside.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.370
Investigations Division 2, also inside, chu.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.620
<i>I've scanned the inside of the ship.</i>

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.240
DeMille Junior is there.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:33.570
ēlDLIVE has infiltrated our ship!

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:36.500
Find them and fire! Kill them all!

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.160
Earth suppression squad, 
burn every part of the Earth!

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:44.440
This is the Earth suppression squad. We are 
currently being attacked by unknown enemies.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.090
Here we go!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.020
Yeah!

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:55.060
Shero, shero, shero, shero, shero.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.000
They've taken over the ship!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:12:00.080
How many of them are there?

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.110
Obrót Akcja!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.440
SPH.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.040
Veronica!

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:18.630
Thanks, Nino.

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:28.880
Leave this to me, 
and you two run ahead, chu.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:30.590
Assistant Inspector Chips!

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:31.450
We're counting on you.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:33.940
Finally...

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:37.700
It's time for me to reveal my true power.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.140
SPH weapon standby, chu.

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:45.980
Program drive, chu!

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.600
Chu...

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.240
Vega!

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:03.590
Has Dolugh come back, Chuta?

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:08.810
This isn't what you promised.

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:34.990
Let's end this.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.420
Vega!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:54.310
My father gave his all to the very end 
as an ēlDLIVE detective.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:57.930
And that's what I wanted to do, too.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:13:59.180
Vega...

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:05.270
Not a DeMille spy... I wanted 
to be a police officer to the end.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:10.060
And yet... you appeared.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.960
Everything is ruined...

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:17.440
...all because of you!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.400
Why didn't you try to quit being a spy?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:23.830
You don't have a recorder or a bomb 
planted inside you, right?!

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:29.520
DeMille is watching all of my family 
back on my home planet.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.570
Your family?

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.000
Which means they're hostages.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.920
No...

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:40.300
If you were in the same position as me, 
there's no way that you'd defy DeMille.

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.850
That might have been true...

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:46.210
...before I joined ēlDLIVE.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:51.730
But now, I'm different! 
No matter how dire the circumstances,

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:53.310
I'm not going to give up until the very end!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.490
You say that so lightly.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:05.320
And what happens if you don't give up?

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:13.510
I'm going to defeat the bad guys...

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:15.690
...and save the people who're important to me!

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:22.680
Both? That's rather greedy.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.580
You might be right...

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.990
But I'm not going to regret it...

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:36.310
I want to eat pasta, curry, 
and hamburg steak...

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:42.990
But if I have to pick one, and if I'm going
 to end up regretting not picking the curry later,

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.090
I should just make all of them!

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.670
Officer Kokonose...

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:00.340
To regret not doing something...

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:08.230
I never, ever, ever, ever...

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.850
...wanna do that again!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.010
Sympathy!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.540
Dolugh!

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:25.910
Eating pasta, curry, and hamburg steak 
is definitely eating too much, Chuta.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:30.840
Nah. If I can't eat it all, 
I'll just share it with the neighbors.

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:33.290
Officer Kokonose!

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:42.110
I'm happy that Dolugh came back. 
Now I can take you to DeMille.

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.100
Like hell I'm going to DeMille!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:47.770
Sadly, I don't care how you feel.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:55.850
I will complete my mission and 
continue living as a member of DeMille.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.370
That's...

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:02.280
...wrong! No matter what!

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:05.910
Salmon.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.200
Officer Kokonose, take this!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:14.510
Sonokata...

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.640
I'm entrusting everything to you.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:19.730
Arrest Inspector Vega without a trace.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:20.800
Yeah!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:26.600
Let's end this, Chuta.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:31.240
Chuta, I'm near my limit! 
We'll end this with a final blow!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.770
Here we go, Dolugh!

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.090
This is the end!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.400
Chuta!

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:46.460
Officer Kokonose!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.670
Sympathy!

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.120
Wh-What is this power?

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:01.500
I won't lose!

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:06.230
Let go! I'm going to run!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.330
Junior-sama.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.470
This sets a bad example for your subordinates!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.950
Found you!

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:11.110
No, let me go!

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.000
We're ēlDLIVE.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.230
Say your prayers, chu.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:23.740
I'll finally be freed from this pain...

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.260
Vega!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:29.090
I can finally be at peace...

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:35.550
I don't want to lose anyone again!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.340
Chuta...

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:46.980
Why did you save me?

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:49.700
I'm not going to let you die here!

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.050
Live, and atone for your crimes.

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:05.210
Chuta, Misuzu, are you all right?

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.570
This is Officer Kokonose. We're all safe.

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:10.750
I see. Well done!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.840
<b>HIROBORI 
Bowl</b>

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.510
<b>Jean Reno Pavilion
Closed Today for 
Cosplay Contest</b>

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.380
Here you go! Freshly-baked muffins!

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:23.180
Yes!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:25.430
Thank you very much.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.550
They look so good!

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.850
Everyone's lives are back to normal.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:37.330
It's a good thing that Vega and his family 
have been secured by ēlDLIVE, huh, Chuta?

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.800
It's all because the chief 
made a request to HQ.

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:43.440
Officer Kokonose.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:48.320
Um... I'm really sorry about the 
whole smell situation the other day.

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:49.680
Smell?

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:53.040
That wasn't just your 
misunderstanding, Chuta?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:57.080
I-I've properly apologized, 
so... if you'll excuse me.

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:59.860
What are those two whispering about?

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:02.550
Are they having an 
important private conversation?

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.150
I'm so interested...

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:06.710
Yes. I'm also interested. In your flesh.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.960
Kopnięcie!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.960
Kick

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:09.570
Whoa, there.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:12.900
Talk about carefree... We aren't even 
done with the ship's repairs yet.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:16.820
Oh, come on. 
Today's a celebration for Chuta.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:21.820
Yeah. Because Officer Kokonose 
arrested Inspector Vega...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.620
...we were able to...

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:26.350
...acquire valuable SPH information 
we can use to defeat DeMille.

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:32.190
Man, I didn't know what was 
gonna happen when that virus hit.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:33.320
I know!

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.260
<b>Let's enjoy the summer 
with Yui Sakuraebi!!</b>

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:41.790
Do you have a minute?

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:49.400
I always end up fighting with you, 
and never really talk to you properly.

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:52.850
Thanks for everything this time.

00:20:54.320 --> 00:21:00.070
You said what I could do is to protect 
the Earth as a member of ēlDLIVE, right?

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:03.740
I think that's why I was able
 to work so hard.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:11.770
But... as always, your actions 
are random and unplanned...

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:16.840
Even when you saved Inspector Vega, 
I can't say that was the right decision.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:17.910
Wha—

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:22.990
However, it's also true that 
it all worked out in the end.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:29.170
I approve you joining ēlDLIVE, 
Officer Kokonose.

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:34.400
Approve? Does that mean 
you disapproved this whole time?

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.960
Good for you, Chuta.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.860
It's not good at all!

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:44.130
To think that Chuta's 
talking to a girl all by himself...

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:52.530
<i>Ever since I joined ēlDLIVE, 
so many hectic things have happened.</i>

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:57.470
<i>There are plenty of things that 
I still don't understand,</i>

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:01.100
<i>but I'm sure I'll be able 
to keep trying hard.</i>

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.950
<i>If that's what it takes 
to protect everyone's smiles...</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Jean Reno Pavillion
Cosplay Party Commemoration!!</b>

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Thank you for all of your support!</b>
